Package: shufflebox
Version: 1.1.1-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ShuffleBox Maintainers <shufflebox@example.invalid>
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), cifs-utils, ffmpeg, mount, systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.52~)
Section: web
Priority: optional
Description: self-hosted SMB media player ShuffleBox
 ShuffleBox is a self-hosted SMB media player with a mobile-friendly web UI,
 favorites, media-library selection, thumbnails and HLS transcoding.
 .
 The package keeps runtime state in /var/lib/shufflebox and does not include SMB
 share addresses, usernames or passwords.
